      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah I think it should be $5 a month, and generally should be framed more as supporting the development of the game, not subscribing to gain benefits/features. I really don't think that the user icon should be tied to this. Further along the line I really hope that major features aren't implemented only to be withheld from unsubscribed users. \nIf it was made $5 a month and the money is going towards bettering the game and being more transparent/responsive about feedback and development, then you've got me on board.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
