        "like": 11
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think the vast majority of people agree that $5 a month is a lot more reasonable for what you get, it's comparable to a Discord Nitro subscription. The intent is that eventually they will add more vrc+ features (like they said) to justify that $10 pricetag, but for right now, it's really not a very good value except for the die-hard VRChat fan. I'll still spend the money since I have thousands of hours in the game, but it does feel like a bit of a rip-off.\nThere probably should have been a two tier system, $5 for what we get now, and then once they're ready to release a lot more perks for VRC+, release a $10 tier with those new perks.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
