      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would be happy to pay $5 a month for some extra nice-to-have features and supporting the team. $10 for what we get and may get in the future doesn't feel like a good value. That's about as much as a Spotify/Netflix/Game Pass/Viveport/etc. subscription. VRC+ isn't a bad idea, it's only the price that's unappealing to many.",
