      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "it is a barrier to entry I'll admit that I would argue it should be a tiered system where $10 per month could be the premium option while a budge option with less features then the premium tier could be completely tolerable say the budge option is $5 per month and gives you the icon function and maybe less extra avatars slots then the premium option it would lower the bar for people to get into VRC+ at the end of the day more people would pay for VRC+ VRC would get money to keep the lights on and people would get something out of it the prices are just a little steep so a budget option would be more appealing to people who want to get into VRC+ so a tiered option would be in my opinion better for all parties involved",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
