  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-20T04:11:19.226Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Not sure what would be a good title for this, so it's \"Pricing Feedback\" for now. Also I want it to be more open ended for other user feedback.\n\nI just want to express that I genuinely think that VRC+ being 10 dollars a month(or $8.33 if you buy yearly) is fairly pricey for what it offers to the end user. I mean this feedback with the best of intentions.\n\nWhile I believe VRChat should be able to monetize itself and I personally want to support VRChat,  $10 a month is pretty steep. It's hard to rationalize paying $100 to $120 dollars a year on this application, on top of other expenses related to VR.  My opinion may change when more features of this are revealed, but as it stands right now it's mostly just a \"Hey I paid $10 this month to have this badge\" badge.",
